WEBVTT

00:09:57.833 --> 00:10:01.476
to save somebody who is super unpopular.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:04.434
But if the race is close,

00:10:04.458 --> 00:10:06.601
all bets are off.

00:10:06.625 --> 00:10:09.393
And then the fight could continue
long past election night.

00:10:09.417 --> 00:10:12.351
You could be, you know,
trying to deal impact

00:10:12.375 --> 00:10:14.976
this whole other process
you never heard of before.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.601
You're going to have to be lobbying,

00:10:17.625 --> 00:10:20.059
protesting, speaking out,
contacting lawmakers,

00:10:20.083 --> 00:10:23.309
a whole other process
you've never done before.

00:10:23.333 --> 00:10:27.518
So landing in this completely
unfamiliar scenario,

00:10:27.542 --> 00:10:29.184
what can you do?

00:10:29.208 --> 00:10:31.434
How are we supposed to act?